#5 Minutes of profile switches 
1. Turn off "Share profile updates with your network" before you edit
2. Open to work: Recruiters only then switch it off
3. Add your changes - title, about, etc
4. Set workplace types and locations - profile location = where you want to work
5. Claim a custom URL

Stay in searches by toggling open to work on n off

